@model PageMeta

<main>


  <!-- ==================== PAGE BANNER ==================== -->
  <section class="page-banner">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>About @School.Name</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== MISSION ==================== -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-layout">

      <div>
        <h2>Our Mission</h2>
        <p>
          At @School.Name, we believe education transforms lives. Our mission is to
          cultivate inquisitive minds, strong character, and a deep sense of purpose
          in every student. We provide a challenging yet nurturing environment where
          young people discover who they are and who they want to become.
        </p>
        <p>
          Through a dynamic blend of rigorous academics, creative expression,
          athletic pursuits, and community engagement, we prepare students not just
          for college, but for lives of meaning and impact.
        </p>

        <!-- [IMAGE: Students collaborating on a project in a sunlit classroom — <img src="..." alt="..." loading="lazy">] -->
        <div class="image-placeholder mt-4" style="min-height:200px;" role="img" aria-label="Students collaborating on a project in a sunlit classroom">Students collaborating in classroom</div>

        <h2 class="mt-5">Our History</h2>
        <p>
          @School.Name was founded in 1995 by a group of educators and parents who
          envisioned a school where children would be known, challenged, and
          loved. What began with 42 students and four classrooms has grown into
          a thriving K–12 community of over 800 students, while staying true to
          the founding belief that every child matters.
        </p>
        <p>
          In 2010, we opened our state-of-the-art Upper School building. In 2018,
          the STEM & Innovation Wing was completed. And in 2025, we launched our
          nationally recognized service-learning program that connects every
          student with meaningful community partnerships.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-5">Leadership</h2>
        <p>Our dedicated leadership team brings decades of educational experience and a shared commitment to student success.</p>

        <div class="leadership-mini mt-3">
          <div class="leader-card">
            <div class="leader-photo">JD</div>
            <h4>Dr. Jane Doe</h4>
            <p class="role">Head of School</p>
            <p style="font-size:0.8rem; color:#888;">Ed.D., Harvard University</p>
          </div>
          <div class="leader-card">
            <div class="leader-photo">JS</div>
            <h4>John Smith</h4>
            <p class="role">Assistant Principal</p>
            <p style="font-size:0.8rem; color:#888;">M.Ed., Stanford University</p>
          </div>
          <div class="leader-card">
            <div class="leader-photo">MR</div>
            <h4>Maria Rodriguez</h4>
            <p class="role">Academic Dean</p>
            <p style="font-size:0.8rem; color:#888;">Ph.D., UC Berkeley</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-2"><a asp-action="Staff">View all staff & faculty →</a></p>

        <h2 class="mt-5">Core Values</h2>
        <ul class="values-grid mt-3">
          <li class="value-card">
            <h4>Integrity</h4>
            <p>We act with honesty, transparency, and strong moral principles in every decision.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="value-card">
            <h4>Respect</h4>
            <p>We honor the dignity of every individual and embrace diverse perspectives.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="value-card">
            <h4>Excellence</h4>
            <p>We set high expectations and provide the support needed to exceed them.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="value-card">
            <h4>Community</h4>
            <p>We build meaningful relationships and contribute to the world beyond our campus.</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Sidebar -->
      <aside class="sidebar">
        <h3>At a Glance</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Established:</strong> 1995</li>
          <li><strong>Grades:</strong> K – 12</li>
          <li><strong>Enrollment:</strong> 800+</li>
          <li><strong>Student-Teacher Ratio:</strong> 12:1</li>
          <li><strong>Average Class Size:</strong> 18</li>
          <li><strong>Faculty with Advanced Degrees:</strong> 78%</li>
        </ul>
        <h3 class="mt-3">Accreditation</h3>
        <p style="font-size:0.85rem;">@School.Name is fully accredited by the [Accrediting Body] and the [State/Regional Association of Independent Schools].</p>
        <h3 class="mt-3">Visit Us</h3>
        <p style="font-size:0.9rem;">Experience @School.Name in person. <a asp-action="Contact">Schedule a campus tour →</a></p>
      </aside>

    </div>
  </section>


</main>
